MID_MV20_01: <SH>
MID_MV20_01_m001: Stay alert! Check for damage, and be quick! 
MID_MV20_01_m002: Report back to me as soon as it's done!
MID_MV20_01_m003: Yes, Your Majesty!
MID_MV20_01_m004: (surprised exert)
MID_MV20_01_m005: (questioning exert)
MID_MV20_01_m006: (noticing exert)
MID_MV20_01_m007: (surprised exert)
MID_MV20_01_m008: It...blots out the sky...
MID_MV20_01_m009: (roar)
MID_MV20_01_m010: So he shows himself.
MID_MV20_01_m011: The timing couldn't be better.
MID_MV20_01_m012: Artemis's Arrow...
MID_MV20_01_m013: The sword of Damocles that\nhangs, waiting above us all.
MID_MV20_01_m014: I never thought to see its power\nunleashed in this day and age.
MID_MV20_01_m015: Yet again...our past misdeeds rise to haunt us.
MID_MV20_01_m016: (two part exert)
MID_MV20_01_m017: Archers, ready arrows!
MID_MV20_01_m018: Fire!
MID_MV20_01_m019: (roar)
MID_MV20_01_m020: Archers, withdraw! Take cover!
MID_MV20_01_m021: Dagda is more a terror than we thought.
MID_MV20_01_m022: Damn it! He's got us trapped like frickin' rats!
MID_MV20_01_m023: Hmph. We stand against a god.\nWe shall show no fear.
MID_MV20_01_m024: Boss, come on!
MID_MV20_01_m025: Enough. Endure it.
MID_MV20_01_m026: (exert of surprise and fear)
MID_MV20_01_m027: (exert of surprise and fear)
MID_MV20_01_m028: Boss!
MID_MV20_01_m029: Your Majesty!
MID_MV20_01_m030: (exert of endurance)
MID_MV20_01_m031: My queen—only a miracle can save us now!
MID_MV20_01_m032: Yes. And one will come.
MID_MV20_01_m033: From where, Your Majesty?!
MID_MV20_01_m034: (roar)
MID_MV20_01_m035: In the sky.
MID_MV20_01_m036: (pained roar)
MID_MV20_01_m037: It can't be...
MID_MV20_01_m038: They've revived an ancient weapon. 